{"type":"standard","title":"Paige Cognetti","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Paige Cognetti</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q107057623","titles":{"canonical":"Paige_Cognetti","normalized":"Paige Cognetti","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Paige Cognetti</span></span>"},"pageid":67690079,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fd/Paige_Cognetti_%2852165104986%29_%283x4a%29.jpg/330px-Paige_Cognetti_%2852165104986%29_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/Paige_Cognetti_%2852165104986%29_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1591,"height":2122},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1367924220","tid":"7190c9f7-912f-11f1-9e45-257c525bc006","timestamp":"2026-08-06T00:40:38Z","description":"American politician","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paige_Cognetti","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paige_Cognetti?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paige_Cognetti?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Paige_Cognetti"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paige_Cognetti","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Paige_Cognetti","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paige_Cognetti?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Paige_Cognetti"}},"extract":"Paige Cognetti is an American politician serving since 2020 as mayor of Scranton, Pennsylvania. She is the first woman to be mayor of the city and won her seat in a special election. A member of the Democratic Party, she ran her first Scranton mayoral campaign as an Independent. She is the Democratic nominee for Pennsylvania's 8th congressional district in 2026.","extract_html":"<p><b>Paige Cognetti</b> is an American politician serving since 2020 as mayor of Scranton, Pennsylvania. She is the first woman to be mayor of the city and won her seat in a special election. A member of the Democratic Party, she ran her first Scranton mayoral campaign as an Independent. She is the Democratic nominee for Pennsylvania's 8th congressional district in 2026.</p>"}